virglrenderer: Neptune (capset 7, D3D11/DXGI virtualization; guest: osy's viogpu3d neptune drivers)
and the render-server changes it needs, from utmapp/virglrenderer (MIT) 5d26f605f50f8e22002ec6db5fb775e1992d4e96.
Its generated protocol headers (src/neptune/neptune-protocol) are not in this patch: build.py copies
them from that pinned archive (sources.json "neptune-protocol").
On macOS arm64 the backend is DXMT's libdxmt-native.dylib (LGPL-2.1), dlopened (never linked) from
libvirglrenderer's own directory. Includes the proxy fence pipe fallback (async fencing without eventfd).
Local: bundled backend path (@loader_path), DXMT capability bits for in-process workers.

  80632a7d osy: server: dispatch render state through a backend enum
  ef1dcd65 osy: server/proxy: return submit_fence sync_file fd via SCM_RIGHTS
  6f82964b osy: neptune: add D3D11/DXGI virtualization backend
  c1095e43 osy: server: log renderer debug messages with a literal format string
  e156b0b7 osy: server: log abnormal worker exits
  583965da osy: neptune: share guest textures as blob-backed dmabufs for cross-context compositing
  7eab5d38 osy: neptune: back the shared-texture model with d3dmetal-native on macOS hosts
  f96757d4 osy: proxy: drive every capset through one universal render server
  8717e91b osy: neptune: report host-backend workaround flags to the guest
  6d8e64f8 osy: neptune: load the darwin D3D backend dynamically
  199452ce osy: neptune: resolve event HANDLEs to their host proxy or NULL
  b7b6978a osy: neptune: publish fence feedback between ring commands
  3cad2e2d osy: util/anon_file: name macOS shm objects for App Sandbox
  49e4e947 osy: server: missing if guard on debug_logger for in-process rendering
  defbdd2a osy: server: only fini the renderers that init brought up
  8f7d804e osy: neptune: carry the exporter's format to blob importers
  d7a11547 osy: virgl_fence: drop table entries whose fd will never signal
  10444e49 osy: render_worker: don't report our own teardown kill as a worker death
  cfbee94a osy: neptune: let an idle ring thread park instead of polling forever
  f4a3a910 osy: neptune: vendor regenerated protocol
  3940f7e0 osy: neptune: host-side D3D12
  0dc6e2f5 osy: venus: guard vkr_renderer_fini against never-initialized state
  81e979ce osy: neptune: fix intermittent ring wedge (drain-thread missed-wakeup + ALIVE race)
  a69ca5ed osy: npt: poll fence/query feedback at 100us instead of 1ms
  8fe7382e osy: npt: per-thread QoS on Darwin, and amortize the feedback deadline check
  d3c4f841 osy: npt: don't leave a ring published when its monitor fails to start
  ac4edcda osy: neptune: backend capability bits in the capset
  5a9491f4 osy: proxy/server: out-of-band SUBMIT_FENCE channel for event-ring fences
  e20aa41d osy: proxy: pipe fallback for the fence eventfd (async fencing on macOS)
  72933a45 osy: neptune: fix event-proxy lifetime races exposed by the OOB fence channel
  f5cbb5a1 osy: neptune/shared: darwin shared-texture POD version 2 with a placement offset
  2db7c781 osy: neptune: pick the API family from the object table for resource ops
  2d4add48 osy: neptune: say which ring words were dirty when a create is rejected
  0bdffb23 osy: neptune: take the per-command shared cache lines out of ring dispatch
  e974b19c osy: neptune: drop reply-less calls on unregistered objects
  f24aa69f osy: proxy: drop the SUBMIT_FENCE reply instead of blocking on it
  99901197 osy: neptune: order multi-ring traffic on the host instead of draining the guest
  441a8074 osy: neptune: place ring threads by ring model
  4b464788 x: neptune: load the bundled libdxmt-native from the library's directory
  88927376 x: neptune: workers in an arm64 process report DXMT's capability bits
  local: server: render workers are threads of one process here, each initializing only its own
